          options: ['A, because €30 per unit beats €18 per unit, whatever the minutes it takes', 'B, because it earns €4.50 per bottleneck minute against €2.50 for A', 'Both equally, as the bottleneck is full either way', 'Neither; the bottleneck should be idle part of the time'],
